A single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as stated in the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. [[cite:obs-b75eb6febbac77286c9b737a1fa1b3edb4671acb "Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only."]]

